WEBVTT

00:00:00.121 --> 00:00:06.457
This video shows how to add a question to the question bank on a phone, and how to find it again.

00:00:08.128 --> 00:00:17.800
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Content Creation, and then choose Question Bank. The list stays empty until you choose a class.

00:00:18.506 --> 00:00:23.738
Tap Add Question at the top of the page. A form opens.

00:00:24.784 --> 00:00:37.624
Choose the class, then the subject, the book and the chapter. Choose the type, here Short Answer, and type the question. Scroll down and tick the topic it tests under Linked Topics.

00:00:56.607 --> 00:01:03.759
Tap Add Question at the bottom of the form. The form closes and a message says the question was added.

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:14.320
To find it again, choose the class and the subject in the filters. The new question is in the list below.

00:01:27.781 --> 00:01:31.453
The question is in the bank, ready for a paper.
